## 📂 Project Structure

```
adaptive_questionnaire_agent/
│
├── main.py                     # Entry point (interactive demo)
├── README.md                   # Project documentation
│
├── agent/
│   ├── models.py               # Data schemas (Pydantic/Dataclasses)
│   ├── state.py                # Session & state management
│   ├── field_registry.py       # Configuration for required fields
│   ├── decision_engine.py      # Core routing logic
│   ├── questionnaire_engine.py # User interaction handler
│   ├── question_catalog.py     # Bank of dynamic questions
│   └── llm_inference_engine.py # LLM integration for deductions
│
└── data/
    ├── mock_data.py            # Test scenarios and user profiles
    └── zillow_mock_api.py      # Simulated external data enrichment
```

